eat to meet you!\n  I really like your art style and would like to invite you to draw my OC，Wood or Vasi . (you can choose one you like to draw．Of course, it would be even better if both characters could be drawn. ）\n  I have no other request, please create any atmosphere you like based on the story—exaggerated movements or distorted characters are all welcome.  You can choose clothes that be suit ,or you can make appropriate adjustments based on the illustration; any changes are acceptable.\n  And the background information I placed in the link could be helpful for the composition.✨✨\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10dOJiXq9PxzcIFu3TrQkwVSzXXJ8UvXo", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@skg9623/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3484900, "client_id": 2797984, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88eedc9cd9bed3d1d4f990ad0c9d2d92", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88eedc9cd9bed3d1d4f990ad0c9d2d92, https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc86d37a08158c3625aae0fa0a4aef38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce1fcaddf6b6dc135bc9256adf392bd5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=79c39983dba650318f547bdc365751a6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=79c39983dba650318f547bdc365751a6, https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01a04f04870baeacdb7693c53a94b3af 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dfdc7393/uploads/origins/0b5d338e-3a98-460b-a7b2-9c65fbfebedf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7d9a3a1e69003eb3046bff4fd5a0e4df 3x"}, "body": "あなたの絵はとても美しい。私のキャラクターを描いてほしいです。\n\n黒く乱れた髪、上向きの細い緑色の目、目の下のクマ、短い前髪、暖かみのあるベージュ色の肌。\n無鉄砲で、直情的で、粘着質で、攻撃的。\n人里離れた廃墟のような街で育った。教育を受けたことがなく、片言の日本語しか話せない。アーチェリーの才能があり、ハーモニカで数曲演奏できる。\n\n雰囲気：廃墟、焼け跡、雪、落書き、孤独、ストリートカルチャー、ヴィンテージノスタルジー、孤独、コラージュ\n\nあなたの絵はどれも素晴らしい。では、お任せします。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-T3ZlFo6Nl6NafmjqtMWnhkmyJepmApV", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@skg9623/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3484900, "client_id": 2028300, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43aee107ff5b6367323569435e29792c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43aee107ff5b6367323569435e29792c, https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e66e2f5a923fe275a848aa68592ed30f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41234e247d19daf795bfef4308bef949 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c94849cf3b8a50e652a76d9e2489fe1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c94849cf3b8a50e652a76d9e2489fe1, https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9d887c545affb8aa78423cfe9a05b734 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fbb7675/uploads/origins/88b3b533-abe2-4716-9b15-d355aa75707f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=238781941d6555840ea68ec5ba32010f 3x"}, "body": "Hi Fukuuji-san!\n\nYour paintings are stunning! Can I ask you to draw something like these? https://skeb.jp/@skg9623/works/5\nhttps://x.com/skg9623/status/1712667916670529556/photo/1\nI would love to commission you to illustrate my OC, Aglaia.\n\nShe is the goddess of beauty in my world. Her design is inspired by the peacock butterfly and stained glass art. In terms of personality, she is a charismatic attention seeker, and what hurts her the most is losing the love of her followers. She is a friendly and benevolent goddess in general. In the future, she would have to face her biggest fear - being forgotten by her followers - and it would lead her to a deep depression state.\nShe currently has 2 outfits; feel free to pick your preferred outfit.\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/30162329.aglaia/gallery", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@skg9623/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3484900, "client_id": 2043744, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=000c7fb5bd1ee7f761f4fa840bbcdb76", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=000c7fb5bd1ee7f761f4fa840bbcdb76, https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23a32dc485e1f741243112a107fd30e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c52cfab0fe791569a2d37c969bb8e078 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28c733ac0d1abe2ee95c3de6cea918ac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28c733ac0d1abe2ee95c3de6cea918ac, https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9cf2510f8a0ead8f53ab69a85281e994 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b6b8970e/uploads/origins/23a9ceea-2e22-4065-baed-bd43aa4d4868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ace38f97f426c7c4efac98fea7b1ffdc 3x"}, "body": "福宇地様初めまして、金丸と申します。\n\n私の創作キャラクター(柴子　ほー)で彼の好きなものをテーマにしたイラストをお願いしたいです。(資料にも記載してありますが星や柑橘系等)\n\n雰囲気や構図、ポーズ等はおまかせいたします。服装は決まっていないので好きなように描いていただけたらと思います。\n\n頂いたイラストの使用目的は観賞用です。\n\n以上になります。承認していただけると幸いです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1zz8IaHiPKaNRuKzn4EXQXLemi02DbSl7/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@skg9623/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3484900, "client_id": 2153641, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=880044de0e380e54a754597dbefa1f51", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=880044de0e380e54a754597dbefa1f51, https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b1a207a07b0e60fec49cd860004d80b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c8c5b7b16ab2eccd8da973e2848143 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c58aa87bcb0ed7aaef7f8134c63c89ef", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c58aa87bcb0ed7aaef7f8134c63c89ef, https://si.imgix.net/3ed9bd6b/uploads/origins/1291522d-0869-41e8-b9bb-b5c2428fe865?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5